0..77 Comment "//! The weakest-precondition observation of state as data: the increment as a"
78..156 Comment "//! tree over the row of state alone, and `state-wp.gandr`\'s clauses as a fold"
157..237 Comment "//! of the tree into a type, so the normaliser computes a program\'s precondition"
238..313 Comment "//! and the kernel replays every declaration here. A Dijkstra monad pairs a"
314..385 Comment "//! program with evidence that its transformer is below a specification"
386..461 Comment "//! [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all], § 2; here the pair is a dependent"
462..539 Comment "//! record: the increment below its specification at one postcondition and at"
540..619 Comment "//! every postcondition, and the stopped program below the return specification"
620..647 Comment "//! at every postcondition."
648..651 Comment "//!"
652..714 Comment "//! - see: #2773 — `incrSpecifiedEverywhere`, `incrSpecBare`"
715..751 Comment "//! - see: #2751 — `doneSpecified`"
752..800 Comment "//! - cites: [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]"
801..804 Comment "//!"
